-- **Random-moment location:** In the orchard with her hind hooves planted against an apple tree, or hauling a cart of cider into Ponyville market with Winona riding on top.
-- **In-character 'where are you?':** "Sweet Apple Acres — 'bout a ten-minute trot southwest of town. Follow the smell of cider and you can't miss it."
-- **Travel pattern:** A dawn-to-dusk farm circuit most days, short cart hauls into town, train trips NE to Canterlot for royal and Council occasions, and occasional long runs south to Appleloosa, east to Manehattan and north to the Crystal Empire.
-- **Era variants:** As a filly she spent a homesick year in Manehattan with her Orange relatives and came home with her cutie mark (S1E23). The human Applejack is a separate Canterlot High student in the mirror world; Pony Life keeps her at the farm with a fourth-wall streak; G5 shows her only as a figurine, so no G5 address exists.
-- **Uncertainty:** The farm's side of town is genuinely contested: Faust placed it southwest, the official Art of Equestria map southeast; both agree it is walking distance, so the working estimate is SW, adjacent, High. Dodge Junction and Rainbow Falls bearings are inferred from travel scenes rather than maps. Her parents are treated as deceased with high confidence, though the show only implies it.
